##### Objective Function

\[
\min \sum_{i \in I} \sum_{j \in J} c_{ij} x_{ij}
\]

##### Constraints

1. **Demand satisfaction:** For each customer group $j \in J$,
   \[
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} \geq d_j
   \]
   That is,
   \begin{align*}
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand1}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand1}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand1}} &\geq 9 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand2}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand2}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand2}} &\geq 66 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand3}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand3}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand3}} &\geq 56 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand4}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand4}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand4}} &\geq 17 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand5}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand5}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand5}} &\geq 43 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand6}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand6}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand6}} &\geq 62 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand7}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand7}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand7}} &\geq 10 \\
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand8}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand8}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply8},\text{demand8}} &\geq 37 \\
   \end{align*}

2. **Supply capacity:** For each supplier $i \in I$,
   \[
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq s_i
   \]
   That is,
   \begin{align*}
   x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand1}} + x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand2}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply1},\text{demand8}} &\leq 60 \\
   x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand1}} + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand2}} + \cdots + x_{\text{supply2},\text{demand8}} &\leq 22 \\
